{"name":"Rita Repulsa","hex":"#00aa55","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"rita","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative form of rta (“Vedic principle”).","Alternative form of ritha (“fish”)"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/rita"}],"entries":[{"title":"Rita Repulsa","blocks":[{"text":"Rita Repulsa is a character from the television series Mighty Morphin Power Rangers, and the principal nemesis of the superhero protagonists in the show's first season. She is portrayed in the first season by Machiko Soga and by Carla Perez in the remaining seasons, while voiced by Barbara Goodson in the series. Soga reprised her role as Rita, now the Mystic Mother, while Susan Brady provided her voice in the TV series Power Rangers Mystic Force. In the films, she is portrayed by Julia Cortez in Mighty Morphin Power Rangers: The Movie, and by Elizabeth Banks in the 2017 reboot film. Rita Repulsa is based on the Kyōryū Sentai Zyuranger villain Witch Bandora."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/cf/Rita_Repulsa_from_Mighty_Morphin%27_Power_Rangers_%28screencap%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rita_Repulsa"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/f8/Rita_Repulsa_Carla_Perez.jpg/330px-Rita_Repulsa_Carla_Perez.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/f8/Rita_Repulsa_Carla_Perez.jpg/330px-Rita_Repulsa_Carla_Perez.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Carla Perez played Rita in season 2 and continued to play her for the rest of the original series.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARita_Repulsa_Carla_Perez.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a6/Mysticmommy.jpg/250px-Mysticmommy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/a6/Mysticmommy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a6/Mysticmommy.jpg/250px-Mysticmommy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Machiko Soga as Rita the Mystic Mother in Power Rangers Mystic Force/Magiel in Mahou Sentai Magiranger","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMysticmommy.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/be/Rita_Repulsa_MMPR_Movie.jpg/250px-Rita_Repulsa_MMPR_Movie.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/be/Rita_Repulsa_MMPR_Movie.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/be/Rita_Repulsa_MMPR_Movie.jpg/250px-Rita_Repulsa_MMPR_Movie.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Julia Cortez as Rita in Mighty Morphin Power Rangers: The Movie","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARita_Repulsa_MMPR_Movie.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d7/Rita_Repulsa_%28Elizabeth_Banks%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d7/Rita_Repulsa_%28Elizabeth_Banks%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"Elizabeth Banks as Rita Repulsa in the 2017 film Power Rangers","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARita_Repulsa_(Elizabeth_Banks).jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}